caption: • Developing the Tradition's distinctive Mastery branches or specializations.
engine-rule: developing-the-tradition-s-distinctive-mastery-branches-or-specializations.

No particular Word cost, skill structure, number of rolls, parameter currency, or advancement ladder is universal. The Tradition must nevertheless provide meaningful breadth and depth. For a non-Skilled Word Tradition, its required mutually exclusive Tradition Paths must create at least three distinct long-term practitioner identities.
